'submit-manuscript'=>array('Submit Manuscript','Start with a publishing enquiry describing your manuscript and intended audience. The editorial team can then advise on scope and the appropriate submission route.','Before submission','Prepare an abstract, authorship and contribution statement, funding and conflict disclosures, and a summary of ethics approval where applicable. Do not send confidential participant data through this form.'),
