'peer-review-policy'=>array('Peer Review Policy','Peer review arrangements must be explained for each journal or publication before submission. This page does not imply that demonstration articles have undergone review.','Assessment principles','Reviewers should have relevant expertise, declare conflicts and protect unpublished material. Authors should address feedback clearly. The applicable review model and appeal process will accompany each active publishing programme.'),
